# Deep2 Qwen32 85TPS — Batch 2/5, item 27
# Base: apply after 0026 and 85TPS Batch 1 item 0024.
# Goal: bind the 1..4-vector Q4_K shader to simultaneous dual-GPU row slices.
# Each GPU reads its resident weight slice once and computes up to four tokens.
#
# Apply:
#   git -C F:\~dev apply --3way 0027_dual_gpu_q4k_batch_target_pass.patch

